<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2 TI - Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raPhauro kuna 2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba Rochipiri RaPhauro Kuna</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTI</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhuku rochipiri raTimoti ndiro tsamba rochipiri ridobva kunhumwa Phauro richienda kumudzidzi wache Timoti. 2 Timoti ndiro tsamba ridonyohwa naPhauro paanga waakusvika kumhera kwoupenyu hwache. Nguwa yakarei wanga adovharihwa mutorongo kuRoma (2 Timoti 1:16). Panga panoukama hudonakitsa pakati paPhauro naTimoti zvokuti Phauro waitomuita mwana wache (VaFiripi 2:22; 1 Timoti 1:2, 18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsamba rakareri ndiro rimwe romatsamba manai yadonyohwa naPhauro kumunhu, aikona kukherekhe. Yamwe matatu yotsamba dzidodai ndiTimoti wokuthanga, Tito naFirimoni. Panguwa yakarei idonyohwa tsamba rochipiri raTimoti vatendi vomunyika dzaitongewa novaRoma vaitambudziwa. Pamwe zvakarezvo ndizvo zvidoita kuti Phauro ave mutorongo futi waisimbisa Timoti kuti achiirire pakuomehwa. Phauro anoraira Timoti zvizinji pamusoro povadzidzisi vomabhwodo mwenze zvaadoita mutsamba yache yokuthanga (1 Timoti 1:16-18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Futi adonyairira Timoti kuti mazuva yaidzotevera paidzova nonguwa idooma (2 Timoti 3:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anothanga nokumoresa Timoti (2 Timoti 1:1-2) ndokudzomukurudzira. (2 Timoti 1:3-18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mumasure maizvozvo anodzokurudzira Timoti kutsungirira (2 Timoti 2:1-13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kubva panaizvozvo, Phauro anotsindikira Timoti kuita zvidofanira muupenyu (2 Timoti 2:14-26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Zvino Phauro anodzochenjedza Timoti pamusoro pozvinoitika pamazuva yari kumberi futi kuti iye ayachenjerere (2 Timoti 3:1—4:8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anopedzisa nokunyaira zvoupenyu hwache kuna Timoti (2 Timoti 4:9-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Kubva kuna Phauro, Nhumwa yaJesu Khirisitu nokuda kwaMwari, maererano nochivimbiso choupenyu huri muna Khirisitu Jesu,<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Kuna Timoti, mwana wangu wandinoda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Mutsa, notsitsi, norugare zvinobva kuna Mwari Baba nokuna Khirisitu Jesu Ishe wedu mbazvive kwauri.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupasa Kutenda noKukurudzira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Ndinotenda Mwari wandinoshumira nohana idochena, kunge zvidoitiwa nomadzibaba yangu, pandinokuyeuka muminamato yangu. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Pandinoyeuka misodzi yako, ndinosuva kukuona masikati nousiku, kuti ndizaziwe nomufaro. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Ndiri kufungisiwa kutenda kwako kudoperera, kutenda kudothanga kugara munaambuya vako Roisi nomuna mai vako Yunisi, iye zvino ndinochokwadi kuti kuri mauri. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Nondava yakarei ndinokukurudzira kuti upfutidzire chipo chaMwari, chiri mauri chidouya nokukubata pamusoro kwandidoita. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Ndava Mwari haanai kutipasa Mweya wokucha, asi Mweya wosimba noworudo nowokuzvidzora.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Saka reka kunyara kuita upfakazi pamusoro paIshe wedu, kana pamusoro pangu inini musungwa wache. Asi batana nainini pakutambudzikira vhangeri nomusimba raMwari, <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />iye adotiponesera upenyu hutsvene— nokudaidza kutsvene, aikona nondava yozvatidoita, asi nokuda kwochinangwa chache nomutsa waadotipasa karekare muna Khirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Iye zvino mutsayo udoisiwa pachenu peno kuburikidza nokuoneka kwoMuponisi wedu, Khirisitu Jesu, adoparadza ipfa ndokuuyisa pachenu upenyu nokusaora, kuburikidza novhangeri.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Nokuda kwovhangeri rakareri ndidosarudziwa kuva muparidzi nonhumwa nomudzidzisi, <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />nokudaro ndiri kutambudzika sezvandiri kuita. Asi handinyadzisiwe nozvakarezvi, ndava ndinoziva wandidotenda, futi ndino chokwadi kuti anokona kuchengeta chandidomuchengetesa kusvikira paZuva rakarero. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Tevera muenzaniso womazvi yadonaka yaudonzva kwandiri, mukutenda nomurudo zviri muna Khirisitu Jesu, <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />chengeta chokwadi chidonaka chidoisiwa mauri noMweya Mutsvene anogara matiri.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Unozviziva kuti vese vari muEzhiya vadondisiya, pakati pavo pana Figerasi naHemogenesi. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Dai Ishe waitira tsitsi imba yaOnesiforasi, ndava anondimutsiridza kadowanda futi haanai kunyadzisiwa nongetani dzangu <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Paadouya kuRoma, adotonditsvagitsitsa kusvikira wandiwana. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Dai Ishe vaita kuti adzowana tsitsi pamberi pache paZuva rakarero. Futi unozivitsitsa ushumiri hwese hwaadopereka paEfeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Muhwi WaKirisitu Jesu Adozvipira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Zvino iwewe, mwanakomana wangu, iva nosimba mumutsa uri muna Khirisitu Jesu, <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />izvozviye zvaudonzva kwandiri pamberi popfakazi dzidowanda uzvipasewo kuvanhu vadotendeka vanokonawo kudzidzisa vamwe.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Ukovane nainini pakutambudzika, fanike muhwi adonaka waKirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Hapanai anoshanda ari muhwi anozvipiringisha nozvinhu zvisiri zvobasa rache, sezvo chinangwa chache nyhokufadza mukuru wache wobasa. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Mumhanyi anopiwaba mubairo wokukunda kunze kwokunge wakwikwidza achitevera mutemo unodiwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Murimi anoshanda nosimba ndiye anofanira kutomora zvidorimiwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Fungitsitsa zvandiri kunyaira, Ishe achakupasa kunzvitsitsa panozvese.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Yeuka Jesu Khirisitu, adomutsiwa kuvadopfa, nzvahwa yaDhavhiti, sezvinonyaihwa novhangeri rangu, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />vhangeri randiri kutambudzikira futi ndidoisiwa ngetani kunge ndaradzi. Asi shoko raMwari harinai kusungiwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Naizvozvo ndinoshingirira pazvinhu zvese nondava yovasaruhwa, kuti naivowo vawane ruponiso ruri muna Khirisitu Jesu, pabodzi nokubhwinya kusingapere. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Kunyaira kudovimbika nghuku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">kana tidopfa pabodzi naye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">tichararamawo pabodzi naye,<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />tikachiirira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">tichatongawo pabodzi naye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Tikamuramba, anotirambawo.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Tikareka kutenda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">iye anoramba adotendeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">ndava anokonaba kuzviramba.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushandi Adokodzera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Ugare uchivafungisa zvinhu zvakarezvi, uvachenjedze pamberi paMwari kuti vareke kuita bopoto pamusoro pomashoko, zvisinai chinhu chidonaka, asi zvinondoparadza vanonzva. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Ita nopaunogona napo pese kuzviisa pamberi paMwari uri munhu adokodzera, mushandi asingafanire kunyadzisiwa anobata zvidonaka shoko rochokwadi, <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />nzvenga kutaura kusinai umwari, ndava vese vanozvipinza muno zvakarezvo vanoramba vachiingidzika mukusaya umwari, <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />futi kunyaira kwavo kunonyekha kunge chironda. Pakati pavo pana Heyimeniyasi naFiretasi, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />vakareva vadopatauka vachibva pachokwadi. Vanototi kumuka kwovadopfa kudoitika kare, vari kuparadza kutenda kwovamwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Zvisinei, nheyo yaMwari inomira idosimba inochisimbiso chokuti, “Ishe anoziva vache,” futi, “Wese anopfakazira zita raIshe mbaabirike panozvidoipa.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Muimba ikuru hamunai midziyo yondarama noyosirivha basi, asi imwe njokuvezewa noyoivhu, imwe yokushandisa zvinokosha imwewo njobasa ridozvidzika. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Avo vese vanozvinatsa pazvinhu zvidofumuka, anodzova mudziyo unoshanda zvinoremekedzewa, udoitiwa mutsvene uchishandisiwa pabasa romuridzi woimba, udonhadzirihwa basa rese ridonaka. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Tiza kuchiva kudoipa kwoukomana utevere kururama, kutenda, rudo norunyararo pabodzi novaye vanodaidza Ishe nomwoyo udochena. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Siyana nonharo dzoudzemwa, dzisinai nonzeru dzese, nokuti unoziva kuti zvinomutsa bopoto. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Zvino muranda waIshe haafanire kuita bopoto asi anofanira kuva munhu anounyoro kuno vese, mbaave anogona kudzidzisa, achiita mwoyo murefu. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Mbaakohorore vaye vanomupikisa nokupfava, dzimwe nguwa Mwari angavapasewo chido chokupinduka kuti vasvikewo pakuziva chokwadi, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />futi kuti vagone kupukunyuka kubva pariva rajabhurosi, iye adovatapa kuti vaite kuda kwache.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Mazuva Yokupedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Asi unzvitsitse kuti mumazuva yokupedzisira kuchava nonguwa inotambudza. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Nokuti vanhu vachava vanozvida, vanoda mari, vanozvitutumadza, vanobatana uyanga, vanoshora Mwari, vasingateerere vabereki, vasingatende, novasiri vatsvene, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />vasinai rudo, vasingaregerere, vanofudza vabiyavo, vasingazvidzore, vanochisa, vanovenga zvidonaka, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />vatengesi, vasinai hanya, vadooma musoro, vanoda mafaro kukunda kuda Mwari <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />vanomufananidzo wokunamata asi vachiramba simba racho. Siyana novanhu vadodaro. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Ndava pakati pavo panovamwe vanoverevedza vachipinda mudzimba, vachipenzveredza vanhukadzi vadoremehwa nozvitadzo, futi vanopupurutsiwa vachigwididzihwa nokuchiva kwavo kudosiyana siyana. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Vakadzi vakareva vanombondodzidza asi havasvike pakuziva chokwadi. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Fanike zvidoitiwa naJenesi naJamburesi vadopikisa Mozisi, saizvozvo vadzidzisi vakareva vanopikisawo chokwadi. Vanhu vadoora mupfungwa, vadoramba kutenda. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Asi hapanai kwavachasvika, ndava udzenga hwavo huchabuda pachenu kuno vese, fanike zvidoitika kuno varume vairi vakarevo.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuraira Kwokupedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Zvino iwewe unoziva kudzidzisa kwangu kwese, unhu hwangu, chinangwa changu muupenyu, kutenda kwangu, mwoyo murefu wangu, rudo rangu, kutsungirira kwangu, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />kutambudziwa kwangu, kudzimbikana kwangu, zvidondiwira kuAndiyoki, kuIkoniyamu nokuRisitira, kutambudziwa kwandidotsungirira makuri. Asi Ishe vadondihwira kuno zvese. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Zvino vese vanoda kurarama upenyu hwoumwari muna Khirisitu Jesu vachatambudziwa, <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />asi vanoita zvidoipa novanyengeri vachanyanyitsa kuipa, vachinyengedza nokunyengedzewa ivo. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Asi iwewe enderera pamberi nokuita zvaudodzidza uchibatitsitsa nozvaudotendesewa, uchiziva kuti mbani adokufundisa zvakarezvo, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />kuti kubva paucheche hwako udoziva magwaro matsvene, yanogona kukurairira kuruponiso kuburikidza nokutenda kuri muna Khirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Magwaro yese yadofemehwa naMwari, futi yanobatsira kudzidzisa, kutsiura, kunhadzirisa, nokupingudza mukururama, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />kuti munhu waMwari ave adokwana zvizere, adonhadzirihwa basa rese ridonaka.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Ndinokuraira pamberi paMwari naKhirisitu Jesu achatonga vapuma novadopfa, pakuoneka kwache noumambo hwache, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />paridza shoko, gara udogadzirira panguwa idofanira noisinai kufanira, kohorora, tsiura, uye kurudzira, nomwoyo murefu mukuru nokunatsa kudzidzisa. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Ndava nguwa ichasvika vanhu pavacharamba dzidziso idonaka, asi nondava yonzeve dzinonyeredzera kunzva zvavanoda vachazviunganidzira vadzidzisi vanonyaira zvinoda kunzviwa nonzeve dzavo. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Vachasiya kutetekera chokwadi votaika vachitetekera zvinzano. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Asi iwewe, ramba udodiha, shingirira pakutambudzika, ita basa romuvhangeri, zazisa ushumiri hwako.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Ndava ndagadzirira kuduruhwa fanike chipiriso chokumwa, futi nguwa yangu yokuenda yasvika. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Ndahwa kuhwa kudonaka, ndapedza mujaho wangu, ndachengeta kutenda. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Zvino ndidochengetehwa korona yokururama, yandichapfupihwa paZuva rakarero naIshe, Mutongi adorurama, aikona kwandiri basi, asi kuno vese vanosuva kuoneka kwache.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mazvi Yache Pachake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Ita paunogona napo kuuya kuno nokamangu, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />nokuti Dhemasi nokuda nyika yazvino, adondisiya, achienda kuThesaronika. Khiresenzi adoenda kuGaratiya, naTito adoenda kuDharomatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Ruka ndiye wandinaye basi. Tora Mariko uuye naye, ndava anondibatsira zvidonyanya paushumira. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Ndidotuma Tikikasi kuEfeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Kana waakuuya ndivikhire jasi randidosiya rina Kapasi kuTiroasi, uuye nomagwaro pakare, kunyanyitsa yaye yokunhadzihwa nomatehwe.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Arekizanda, uye wokupfura ndarira adondibata uyanga zvidoipitsa, Ishe achamutsiidza panozvaadoita. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Naiwepa ugare udomuchenjerera, nokuti anoshora shoko redu zvidokungudza.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Pandidothanga kuzvidziirira hapanai adondiretserera, asi vese vadonditiza. Dai vareka kupasiwa mhosva nondava iyoyo. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Asi Ishe adomira nainini, kuti kuburikidza nainini shoko riparidziwe zvidozara kuti voyamwe marudzi varinzve. Futi ndidonunuhwa kubva mukamwa momhondoro. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Ishe achandipukunyutsa kubva kuno zvidoipa zvese wondiponesa kuti andisvitse muumambo hwache hwokudenga. Kwaari mbakuve nokubhwinya nokusingaperepere. Ameni.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumoresana Kwokupedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Ndinotumira kwaziso yangu kuna Pirisira naAkwira nokumhuri yaOnesiforasi. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erasitasi adosara kuKorinde, futi ndidosiya Tirofimasi achihwara kuMiretasi. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Ita nopaunogona napo kuuya kuno kamangu nguwa yomhepo isati yasvika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Yubhurasi, Pudhenzi, Rinasi naKiraudhiya novamwe maKhirisitu vese vari kukumoresai.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Ishe mbaave nomweya wako.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Mutsa mbauve nemi mese.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>